WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.973
Spring is beginning.

2
00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:15.085
I open the window.

3
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:18.489
The air is fresh.

4
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.784
The animals are waking up.

5
00:00:22.785 --> 00:00:25.657
I watch the animals.

6
00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:29.463
They stretch and yawn.

7
00:00:29.464 --> 00:00:32.064
The flowers are blooming.

8
00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.800
I smell the flowers.

9
00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.160
They smell good.

10
00:00:37.161 --> 00:00:39.850
The grass is growing.

11
00:00:39.851 --> 00:00:42.124
I look at the grass.

12
00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.930
It is so green.

13
00:00:44.931 --> 00:00:47.796
The birds are singing.

14
00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:50.581
I listen to the birds.

15
00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:53.152
They are in their nest.

16
00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.795
My friends are waving.

17
00:00:55.796 --> 00:00:57.843
I wave too.

18
00:00:57.844 --> 00:01:00.410
I think about picnics.

19
00:01:00.411 --> 00:01:02.855
My friends are sitting.

20
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:04.880
I lie down.

21
00:01:04.881 --> 00:01:08.069
We feel the cool breeze.

22
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.413
It is raining!

23
00:01:10.414 --> 00:01:12.129
We get wet!

24
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:20.351
We say good-bye and run home!
